  "name": "B8000 - Shared Folders Control",
  "description": "Intent: Block-tier hard enforcement on Shared Folder copy / move / rename_copy / download at sensitivity floor [3,4] — shuts down sensitive data moving out of corporate-internal sensitive shares (HR, finance, legal, M&A folders) or into unauthorized network shares. Exclusions: scoped to the Sensitive Internal Share dataset and Authorized share lists; ships disabled — enable after File_Paths_Authorized_Sensitive_Internal_Network_Share is populated and W8000 is clean. Requirements: WIP — pending analyst testing.",
  "severity": "critical",
  "disabled": true,
